## 问题
文档让读者拿 aclnnAddmm 示例代码编译运行,并贴出 result[0..7] = 1.2,2.2,3.2,5.4,...;但用该示例的真实输入实算,结果应是 7.2,9.4,11.6,13.8,18.4,21.8,25.2,28.6。

## 读者会遇到什么
读者跑出来的数和文档贴的完全不同,会怀疑是自己环境或步骤出错。

## 代码原文 / 实际情况(去仓核对)
`matmul/mat_mul_v3/docs/aclnnAddmm&aclnnInplaceAddmm.md`(第 599–619 行)·被引示例的输入:self={0..7}、mat1、mat2、α=1.2、β=1.0:
```
 599 |   std::vector<int64_t> selfShape = {2, 4};
 600 |   std::vector<int64_t> mat1Shape = {2, 3};
 601 |   std::vector<int64_t> mat2Shape = {3, 4};
 602 |   std::vector<int64_t> outShape = {2, 4};
 603 |   void* selfDeviceAddr = nullptr;
 604 |   void* mat1DeviceAddr = nullptr;
 605 |   void* mat2DeviceAddr = nullptr;
 606 |   void* outDeviceAddr = nullptr;
 607 |   aclTensor* self = nullptr;
 608 |   aclTensor* mat1 = nullptr;
 609 |   aclTensor* mat2 = nullptr;
 610 |   aclScalar* alpha = nullptr;
 611 |   aclScalar* beta = nullptr;
 612 |   aclTensor* out = nullptr;
 613 |   std::vector<float> selfHostData = {0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7};
 614 |   std::vector<float> mat1HostData = {1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2};
 615 |   std::vector<float> mat2HostData = {1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 4};
 616 |   std::vector<float> outHostData(8, 0);
 617 |   int8_t cubeMathType = 1;
 618 |   float alphaValue = 1.2f;
 619 |   float betaValue = 1.0f;
```

`matmul/mat_mul_v3/docs/aclnnAddmm&aclnnInplaceAddmm.md`(第 652–668 行)·被引示例的调用与打印:
```
 652 |   // 调用aclnnAddmm第二段接口
 653 |   ret = aclnnAddmm(workspaceAddr, workspaceSize, executor, stream);
 654 |   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT("aclnnAddmm failed. ERROR: %d.\n[ERROR msg]%s", ret, aclGetRecentErrMsg()); return ret);
 655 | 
 656 |   // 4.（固定写法）同步等待任务执行结束
 657 |   ret = aclrtSynchronizeStream(stream);
 658 |   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT("aclrtSynchronizeStream failed. ERROR: %d.\n[ERROR msg]%s", ret, aclGetRecentErrMsg()); return ret);
 659 | 
 660 |   // 5. 获取输出的值，将device侧内存上的结果拷贝至host侧，需要根据具体API的接口定义修改
 661 |   auto size = GetShapeSize(outShape);
 662 |   std::vector<float> resultData(size, 0);
 663 |   ret = aclrtMemcpy(resultData.data(), resultData.size() * sizeof(resultData[0]), outDeviceAddr,
 664 |                     size * sizeof(resultData[0]), ACL_MEMCPY_DEVICE_TO_HOST);
 665 |   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT("copy result from device to host failed. ERROR: %d.\n[ERROR msg]%s", ret, aclGetRecentErrMsg()); return ret);
 666 |   for (int64_t i = 0; i < size; i++) {
 667 |     LOG_PRINT("result[%ld] is: %f\n", i, resultData[i]);
 668 |   }
```

按 `out = β·self + α·(mat1 @ mat2)` 代入实算:`result = 7.2, 9.4, 11.6, 13.8, 18.4, 21.8, 25.2, 28.6`(与文档贴的 1.2,2.2,3.2… 不符)。

## 代码位置(完整指引)
- 编译与运行样例.md 运行结果示例 result[0..7] = 1.2,2.2,3.2,5.4,6.4,7.4,9.6,10.6
- matmul/mat_mul_v3/docs/aclnnAddmm&aclnnInplaceAddmm.md:599-619 输入数据、:652-668 调用与打印

## 建议改为
把运行结果示例换成被引示例真实输入的实算值 7.2,9.4,11.6,13.8,18.4,21.8,25.2,28.6;或与所引示例的输入数据保持一致。

**问题类型**:文档贴出的示例代码本身有问题
**文档**:`docs/QUICKSTART.md`
**严重程度**:会让人困惑 / 走弯路或误判,但能恢复

